  "label": "Social Condition",
  "description": "Economic disadvantage refers to a lack of financial resources or opportunities. The meme juxtaposes the woman's apparent poverty (implied by her traditional attire and setting) with the accusation that she still 'picks your pocket,' which is used to reinforce the stereotype that people from Romania are dishonest, even when they are economically disadvantaged.",
